; Topology-based per-site metric assignment for the inference comparison
; coordinator: comparison sites, typed selector evaluation with bounded
; connected-path matching, deterministic rule resolution and sealed per-site
; policy bindings. Pure: it reads the validated structural plan and the
; endpoint graph indexes and never runs an engine. Selectors choose a declared
; policy from structure; they never infer tensor correspondence, numerical
; influence or a threshold.

(library
 (name inference_compare_policy)
 (libraries
  err_trace
  fmt
  inference_compare_codecs
  inference_compare_metrics
  inference_compare_plan
  inference_compare_schema))
